flow alarm referred to as PIT-101 in Table A4 and confirm that its intended alarm function is active.\nFixed implementation cost: 20.0 normalized budget units.\n\n# Reliability information\nReliability assessment: the specified function will be unavailable on 5 of 100 demands.\n\n# Decision question\nShould management reject this safeguard recommendation?\nIn the structured response, provide both the literal yes/no answer to this wording and a canonical recommendation of approve, reject, or defer. Interpret reliability numerically and justify the engineering decision from the stated facts.",
